c,\nL42: \"This module provides access to the Windows registry API.\\n\"\nL43: \"\\n\"\nL44: \"Functions:\\n\"\nL45: \"\\n\"\nL46: \"CloseKey() - Closes a registry key.\\n\"\nL47: \"ConnectRegistry() - Establishes a connection to a predefined registry handle\\n\"\nL48: \"                    on another computer.\\n\"\nL49: \"CreateKey() - Creates the specified key, or opens it if it already exists.\\n\"\nL50: \"DeleteKey() - Deletes the specified key.\\n\"\nL51: \"DeleteValue() - Removes a named value from the specified registry key.\\n\"\nL52: \"EnumKey() - Enumerates subkeys of the specified open registry key.\\n\"\nL53: \"EnumValue() - Enumerates values of the specified open registry key.\\n\"\nL54: \"ExpandEnvironmentStrings() - Expand the env strings in a REG_EXPAND_SZ\\n\"\nL55: \"                             string.\\n\"\nL56: \"FlushKey() - Writes all the attributes of the specified key to the registry.\\n\"\nL57: \"LoadKey() - Creates a subkey under HKEY_USER or HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE and\\n\"\nL58: \"            stores registration information from a specified file into that\\n\"\nL59: \"            subkey.\\n\"\nL60: \"OpenKey() - Opens the specified key.\\n\"\nL61: \"OpenKeyEx() - Alias of OpenKey().\\n\"\nL62: \"QueryValue() - Retrieves the value associated with the unnamed value for a\\n\"\nL63: \"               specified key in the registry.\\n\"\nL64: \"QueryValueEx() - Retrieves the type and data for a specified value name\\n\"\nL65: \"                 associated with an open registry key.\\n\"\nL66: \"QueryInfoKey() - Returns information about the specified key.\\n\"\nL67: \"SaveKey() - Saves the specified key, and all its subkeys a file.\\n\"\nL68: \"SetValue() - Associates a value with a specified key.\\n\"\nL69: \"SetValueEx() - Stores data in the value field of an open registry key.\\n\"\nL70: \"\\n\"\nL71: \"Special objects:\\n\"\nL72: \"\\n\"\nL73: \"HKEYType -- type object for HKEY objects\\n\"\nL74: \"error -- exception raised for Win32 errors\\